            "review_title": "Review at Halal Food Karim Da Nang",
            "review_text": "İbrahim Ö\n2 contributions\n0\nIf a Muslim does this!\nJul 2026 • Couples\nWe had a very disappointing experience. There was no sign at the entrance, on the menu, or anywhere in the restaurant saying that only cash was accepted. After we finished our meal, we were told that Visa and Mastercard were not accepted. We were asked to withdraw cash from an ATM or pay in US dollars at an unfavorable exchange rate. We had no cash and had to borrow money from another customer. In addition, the final bill was higher than the prices shown on the menu. This experience was stressful and unacceptable. Please clearly inform customers in advance if you only accept cash.\nRead more\nWritten July 21, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
