            "review_title": "Review at Halal Food Karim Da Nang",
            "review_text": "Aiman\nPerth, Australia38 contributions\n0\nGreat Halal food pitstop and Masjid for solah.\nApr 2026 • Couples\nGreat Halal food stop for muslim brothers and sisters in Da Nang. Food is vietnam-Indonesian fusion, and food is great and restaurant is clean. Bonus is that there is masjid above the restaurant, for convenience to perform solah. Only downside is this place only accepts CASH.\nWritten April 1, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
