            "review_text": "Hermanshah\nSingapore, Singapore524 contributions\n1\nClean and good halal food\nOct 2023 • Couples\nIt is quite challenging for muslim travellers in Danang to find a proper halal establishment for dining..alhamdullilah..Karim halal restauraunt is 1 of the restaurant that you could dine in without was was. As of my research there is only 2 halal eatery in danang that you could trust..\n\nKarim halal restaurant is clean and brightly lit.. serving dishes influence from malaysia and thailand..the menu however is not extensive but ample enough for choices..\nI attached some photos of the food i had during my visits to Karim restaurant..\n\nDepending on where you stay, grab or taxi seems to be the easiest option to the restaurant..i stay at My Khe beach area and it cost us 50000-65000 VND via grab to come here..\n\nI recommend you to come here and support the restaurant..\nRead more\nWritten October 12, 2023",
